# wiring.pdl - where the conductor finds its helpers, paths relative to THIS folder (so two scratch runs have identical bytes). Install layout: <house>/game/conductor, <house>/game/participants.
WIRING | lc_clock       | ../../lc.+x
WIRING | house          | ../..
WIRING | clock          | g1
WIRING | first_ms       | 86400000
WIRING | repeat         | every:1day
WIRING | start_rate     | x86400
WIRING | snapshot       | ../../gso
WIRING | store          | ../../store
WIRING | tree           | ..
WIRING | participants   | ../participants
WIRING | template       | participant_template
WIRING | control_ledger | ../../eden_control.txt
# --- v1 (defaults shown; every one is optional). world / world_templates: where Start game spawns house, chickens, plants; slots_index / slot_file live OUTSIDE the game tree so a Load does not rewind them.
WIRING | world           | ../world
WIRING | world_templates | world_templates
WIRING | slots_index     | ../../slots.pdl
WIRING | slot_file       | ../../slot.txt
# tomom talk (scratch copy only; unset = the phrase fallback). tomom_bin = the tomom-hq chatbot_seed7 binary built on a scratch copy, tomom_dir = that copy's folder (cwd of the Ask).
# WIRING | tomom_bin | ../../tomom/chatbot_seed7
# WIRING | tomom_dir | ../../tomom
